# WAITS ON: Hinekora's Lock, a choice over an operation's outcomes (ROADMAP.md,
# deferred by design).
#
# Hinekora's Lock on a Magic amulet (the Craicic Croaker + Black Mórrígan
# beastcraft): preview the Regal Orb and apply it only when it adds a suffix,
# otherwise spend the preview on a Blessed Orb and lock again. The proposed
# spelling keeps only the outcomes that satisfy the predicate and joins them
# with the unchanged item; the loop then reads exactly as the craft does.

item {
    base:     "Turquoise Amulet"
    ilvl:     84
    rarity:   magic
    prefixes: [ fractured "damage over time multiplier" t1, "level of all skill gems" t1 ]
}

until isRare {
    lock regal keep suffixCount == 1
}

bench "prefixes cannot be changed"
bench "can have up to 3 crafted modifiers"
harvest augment "fire"
